deg;C, %.0f %%%s%s<br>␀␀␀<h3>Diagnostics</h3><p>Last starts (most recent first):<br>␀<h3>Diagnosztika</h3><p>UtolsÃ³ indulÃ¡sok (legutÃ³bbi elÃ¶l):<br>␀␀(no time) - %s<br>␀␀(idÅ‘pont nÃ©lkÃ¼l) - %s<br>␀␀␀␀<p style='color:#ff8a80'><b>Saved crash</b><br>␀<p style='color:#ff8a80'><b>Mentett Ã¶sszeomlÃ¡s</b><br>␀␀␀␀Clear crash data␀␀␀␀Ã–sszeomlÃ¡s-adat tÃ¶rlÃ©se␀<p>Saved crash: none</p>␀␀␀␀<p>Mentett Ã¶sszeomlÃ¡s: nincs</p>␀␀Network: <b>%s</b>, signal: %d dBm, TX power: %s, IP: %s␀␀␀␀HÃ¡lÃ³zat: <b>%s</b>, jelerÅ‘ssÃ©g: %d dBm, adÃ³teljesÃ­tmÃ©ny: %s, IP: %s␀␀Not connected.␀␀Nincs kapcsolat.␀␀␀␀Search for networks␀HÃ¡lÃ³zatok keresÃ©se␀␀␀(search for networks first)␀(elÅ‘bb keresd meg a hÃ¡lÃ³zatokat)␀Network name␀␀␀␀HÃ¡lÃ³zat neve␀␀JelszÃ³␀Show password␀␀␀JelszÃ³ mutatÃ¡sa␀␀␀Connect to the new network␀␀CsatlakozÃ¡s az Ãºj hÃ¡lÃ³zathoz␀␀␀␀The display tries the new network; if it does not succeed within 25 s, it goes back to the current one. On a new network it may get a different IP address: you see it in the top line of the display (it must also be changed in the consoles).␀␀␀␀A kijelzÅ‘ kiprÃ³bÃ¡lja az Ãºj hÃ¡lÃ³zatot; ha 25 mp alatt nem sikerÃ¼l, visszaÃ¡ll a mostanira. Ãšj hÃ¡lÃ³zaton mÃ¡s IP-cÃ­met kaphat: ezt a kijelzÅ‘ felsÅ‘ sorÃ¡ban lÃ¡tod (a konzoloknÃ¡l is Ã¡t kell Ã­rni).␀␀␀Start the setup portal (restarts, 5 minutes)␀␀␀␀BeÃ¡llÃ­tÃ³ portÃ¡l indÃ­tÃ¡sa (Ãºjraindul, 5 perc)␀var T=['Searching...',', secured',', open','Search for networks','Failed, try again'];␀␀var T=['KeresÃ©s...',', jelszavas',', nyÃ­lt','HÃ¡lÃ³zatok keresÃ©se','Nem sikerÃ¼lt, Ãºjra'];␀␀<h3>Settings</h3><form method='POST' action='/settings'><label>Latitude (e.g. 51.5074)</label>␀␀<h3>BeÃ¡llÃ­tÃ¡sok</h3><form method='POST' action='/settings'><label>FÃ¶ldrajzi szÃ©lessÃ©g (pl. 47.4979)</label>␀␀␀'><label>Longitude (e.g. -0.1278)</label>␀␀␀'><label>FÃ¶ldrajzi hosszÃºsÃ¡g (pl. 19.0402)</label>␀␀␀Find location by IP␀Hely keresÃ©se IP alapjÃ¡n␀␀Time zone␀␀␀IdÅ‘zÃ³na␀␀␀ selected>␀␀ selected␀␀␀Other (POSIX TZ string)␀EgyÃ©b (POSIX TZ szÃ¶veg)␀␀␀<h3>Consoles and rooms</h3><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>The console identifier is a part of the <i>model</i> or <i>stationtype</i> field sent by the console (e.g. WS3910). Left empty, the place is not used. The outdoor (WS90) data also comes from the console of place 1. Battery alarm: warns below this voltage (0 = off).</p><p style='color:#aaa'>Consoles sending now: ␀<h3>Konzolok Ã©s helyisÃ©gek</h3><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>A konzol azonosÃ­tÃ³ja egy rÃ©szlet a konzol Ã¡ltal kÃ¼ldÃ¶tt <i>model</i> vagy <i>stationtype</i> mezÅ‘bÅ‘l (pl. WS3910). Ãœresen hagyva a hely nincs hasznÃ¡latban. Az 1. hely konzoljÃ¡tÃ³l jÃ¶n a kinti (WS90) adat is. AkkuriasztÃ¡s: e feszÃ¼ltsÃ©g alatt figyelmeztet (0 = nincs).</p><p style='color:#aaa'>Most kÃ¼ldÅ‘ konzolok: ␀␀ (not assigned)␀ (nincs hozzÃ¡rendelve)␀egyik sem␀␀␀<h4 style='margin:14px 0 0'>Place %d%s</h4><label>Name</label><input name='r%dn' maxlength='15' value='%s'><label>Console identifier</label><input name='r%dm' maxlength='20' value='%s'><label>Battery alarm (V)</label><input name='r%dv' type='number' step='0.1' min='0' max='10' value='%.1f'>␀<h4 style='margin:14px 0 0'>%d. hely%s</h4><label>NÃ©v</label><input name='r%dn' maxlength='15' value='%s'><label>Konzol azonosÃ­tÃ³ja</label><input name='r%dm' maxlength='20' value='%s'><label>AkkuriasztÃ¡s (V)</label><input name='r%dv' type='number' step='0.1' min='0' max='10' value='%.1f'>␀␀␀ (outdoor data also comes from here)␀␀␀␀ (innen jÃ¶n a kinti adat is)␀␀␀<option value='0'>Magyar</option><option value='1' selected>English</option>␀␀␀␀<option value='0' selected>Magyar</option><option value='1'>English</option>␀␀␀␀<h3>Night mode</h3>␀<h3>Ã‰jszakai mÃ³d</h3>␀ style='width:auto;margin:0 8px 0 0'>On</label><label>Schedule</label><select name='n_mode' style='font-size:18px;width:100%%;margin:14px 0'><option value='0'%s>By clock (the times below)</option><option value='1'%s>By sunset (needs the location)</option></select>␀␀␀␀ style='width:auto;margin:0 8px 0 0'>Bekapcsolva</label><label>IdÅ‘zÃ­tÃ©s</label><select name='n_mode' style='font-size:18px;width:100%%;margin:14px 0'><option value='0'%s>Ã“ra szerint (a lenti idÅ‘pontok)</option><option value='1'%s>Napnyugta szerint (hely kell hozzÃ¡)</option></select>␀␀␀<label>By clock: start</label><input type='time' name='n_st' value='%02d:%02d'><label>By clock: end</label><input type='time' name='n_en' value='%02d:%02d'>␀␀␀␀<label>Ã“ra szerint: kezdete</label><input type='time' name='n_st' value='%02d:%02d'><label>Ã“ra szerint: vÃ©ge</label><input type='time' name='n_en' value='%02d:%02d'>␀␀␀␀<label>By sunset: start, minutes after sunset (-120..180)</label><input type='number' name='n_so' min='-120' max='180' step='5' value='%d'><label>By sunset: end, minutes after sunrise (-120..180)</label><input type='number' name='n_ro' min='-120' max='180' step='5' value='%d'>␀␀␀<label>Napnyugta szerint: kezdete a napnyugta utÃ¡n (perc, -120..180)</label><input type='number' name='n_so' min='-120' max='180' step='5' value='%d'><label>Napnyugta szerint: vÃ©ge a napkelte utÃ¡n (perc, -120..180)</label><input type='number' name='n_ro' min='-120' max='180' step='5' value='%d'>␀<label>Night brightness (%%, 1-100)</label><input type='number' name='n_pct' min='1' max='100' value='%d'><label>Day brightness (%%, 10-100)</label><input type='number' name='d_pct' min='10' max='100' value='%d'>␀␀␀␀<label>Ã‰jszakai fÃ©nyerÅ‘ (%%, 1-100)</label><input type='number' name='n_pct' min='1' max='100' value='%d'><label>Nappali fÃ©nyerÅ‘ (%%, 10-100)</label><input type='number' name='d_pct' min='10' max='100' value='%d'>␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Also adjustable on the display (times in 15-minute steps): tap the clock on the main page.</p>␀␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>A kijelzÅ‘n is Ã¡llÃ­thatÃ³ (az idÅ‘pontok 15 perces lÃ©pÃ©sekben): a fÅ‘oldalon az Ã³rÃ¡ra koppintva.</p>␀␀␀<h3>Phone notifications (ntfy)</h3><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Install the free <b>ntfy</b> app on your phone and subscribe to the same topic that you enter here. The topic is practically a password: make it unique and hard to guess (e.g. weather-example-q8m2v; only letters, digits, - and _). Left empty, there are no notifications. During night mode only frost and crash notifications are sent.</p><label>Topic</label>␀<h3>Ã‰rtesÃ­tÃ©sek a telefonra (ntfy)</h3><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>TelepÃ­tsd a telefonra az ingyenes <b>ntfy</b> appot, Ã©s iratkozz fel ugyanarra a tÃ©mÃ¡ra, amit itt megadsz. A tÃ©ma gyakorlatilag jelszÃ³: legyen egyedi Ã©s nehezen kitalÃ¡lhatÃ³ (pl. idojaras-pelda-q8m2v; csak betÅ±, szÃ¡m, - Ã©s _). Ãœresen hagyva nincs Ã©rtesÃ­tÃ©s. Az Ã©jszakai mÃ³d idejÃ©n csak a fagy Ã©s az Ã¶sszeomlÃ¡s megy ki.</p><label>TÃ©ma</label>␀␀␀␀ checked␀␀␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Last notification: ␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>UtolsÃ³ kÃ¼ldÃ©s: ␀␀␀nothing sent yet␀␀␀␀mÃ©g nem kÃ¼ldÃ¶tt␀␀<h3>Sound alert</h3>␀␀␀␀<h3>HangjelzÃ©s</h3>␀␀␀␀Sound alert when "Ventilate" appears</label><label>Volume (plays when chosen; save with the button below)</label>␀␀␀HangjelzÃ©s, amikor megjelenik a "SzellÅ‘ztess"</label><label>HangerÅ‘ (vÃ¡lasztÃ¡skor megszÃ³lal; mentÃ©s a lenti gombbal)</label>␀' selected>␀MeghallgatÃ¡s␀␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Silent during the night mode period (by clock or by sunset, see above), even if dimming is off. Also adjustable on the display: Settings / System.</p>␀␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Az Ã©jszakai mÃ³d idÅ‘szakÃ¡ban (Ã³ra vagy napnyugta szerint, lÃ¡sd fent) nem szÃ³l, akkor sem, ha a sÃ¶tÃ©tÃ­tÃ©s ki van kapcsolva. A kijelzÅ‘n is Ã¡llÃ­thatÃ³: BeÃ¡llÃ­tÃ¡sok / Rendszer.</p>␀<h3>Forwarding to another display</h3><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>This display forwards the data received from the consoles unchanged to the <i>/ecowitt</i> address of the given display (e.g. idojaras-p4.local or 192.168.1.50). If the target is not reachable, this display keeps working normally. Phone notifications need to be set up on one display only.</p>␀␀<h3>TovÃ¡bbkÃ¼ldÃ©s mÃ¡sik kijelzÅ‘re</h3><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>A konzoloktÃ³l kapott adatokat ez a kijelzÅ‘ vÃ¡ltozatlanul tovÃ¡bbkÃ¼ldi a megadott kijelzÅ‘ <i>/ecowitt</i> cÃ­mÃ©re (pl. idojaras-p4.local vagy 192.168.1.50). Ha a cÃ©l nem Ã©rhetÅ‘ el, ennek a kijelzÅ‘nek a mÅ±kÃ¶dÃ©se nem vÃ¡ltozik. Telefonos Ã©rtesÃ­tÃ©st elÃ©g az egyiken beÃ¡llÃ­tani.</p>␀␀␀Forwarding on</label><label>Target (host name or IP)</label>␀␀␀␀TovÃ¡bbkÃ¼ldÃ©s bekapcsolva</label><label>CÃ©l (gÃ©pnÃ©v vagy IP)</label>␀␀␀'><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Last forward: ␀'><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>UtolsÃ³ tovÃ¡bbkÃ¼ldÃ©s: ␀␀%s (successful: %u, failed: %u, dropped: %u)␀␀␀␀%s (sikeres: %u, hibÃ¡s: %u, elmaradt: %u)␀␀no target set␀␀␀nincs megadva cÃ©l␀␀off␀kikapcsolva␀<h3>Password</h3>␀␀␀<h3>JelszÃ³</h3>␀␀␀␀Change password</label><input type='password' name='newpw' id='newpw' maxlength='32' autocomplete='new-password' disabled placeholder='new password (empty: no password)'><input type='password' name='newpw2' id='newpw2' maxlength='32' autocomplete='new-password' disabled placeholder='new password again'><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Password now: ␀␀␀JelszÃ³ mÃ³dosÃ­tÃ¡sa</label><input type='password' name='newpw' id='newpw' maxlength='32' autocomplete='new-password' disabled placeholder='Ãºj jelszÃ³ (Ã¼resen hagyva: nincs jelszÃ³)'><input type='password' name='newpw2' id='newpw2' maxlength='32' autocomplete='new-password' disabled placeholder='Ãºj jelszÃ³ mÃ©g egyszer'><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>JelszÃ³ most: ␀set (user name: admin)␀␀be van Ã¡llÃ­tva (felhasznÃ¡lÃ³nÃ©v: admin)␀nincs␀␀␀Save settings</button><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Saves the location, time zone, rooms, night mode, notifications, forwarding and (if ticked) the password at once.</p></form><form method='POST' action='/ntfytest'><button type='submit' style='background:#444;color:#eee'>Send a test message to the phone</button></form><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>The test message goes to the topic already saved.</p><p style='color:#aaa'>The location is needed for sunrise/sunset and the forecast. The IP lookup queries ipwho.is from your browser (fallback: ip-api.com); it is only accurate to a city (often the provider's location), check it before saving.</p>␀␀BeÃ¡llÃ­tÃ¡sok mentÃ©se</button><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Egyszerre menti a helyet, az idÅ‘zÃ³nÃ¡t, a helyisÃ©geket, az Ã©jszakai mÃ³dot, az Ã©rtesÃ­tÃ©seket, a tovÃ¡bbkÃ¼ldÃ©st Ã©s (ha bepipÃ¡ltad) a jelszÃ³t.</p></form><form method='POST' action='/ntfytest'><button type='submit' style='background:#444;color:#eee'>PrÃ³baÃ¼zenet kÃ¼ldÃ©se a telefonra</button></form><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>A prÃ³baÃ¼zenet a mÃ¡r elmentett tÃ©mÃ¡ra megy.</p><p style='color:#aaa'>A hely a napkelte/napnyugtÃ¡hoz Ã©s az elÅ‘rejelzÃ©shez kell. Az IP alapÃº keresÃ©s a bÃ¶ngÃ©szÅ‘dbÅ‘l kÃ©rdezi le az ipwho.is-t (tartalÃ©k: ip-api.com); ez csak vÃ¡rosnyi pontossÃ¡gÃº (gyakran a szolgÃ¡ltatÃ³ kÃ¶zpontja), mentÃ©s elÅ‘tt ellenÅ‘rizd.</p>␀var L=['The two passwords do not match.','Searching...','Found: ',' - check it before saving!','Failed: none of the location services is reachable.'];␀␀var L=['A kÃ©t jelszÃ³ nem egyezik.','KeresÃ©s...','TalÃ¡lat: ',' - mentÃ©s elÅ‘tt ellenÅ‘rizd!','Nem sikerÃ¼lt: egyik helykeresÅ‘ szolgÃ¡ltatÃ¡s sem Ã©rhetÅ‘ el.'];␀␀␀<h3>Firmware update</h3><p>Choose the <b>.bin</b> file (the release's <i>â€¦-ota.bin</i> file, or built with PlatformIO: <i>.pio/build/&lt;environment&gt;/firmware.bin</i>).</p>␀␀␀<h3>Firmware frissÃ­tÃ©s</h3><p>VÃ¡laszd ki a <b>.bin</b> fÃ¡jlt (a kiadÃ¡s <i>â€¦-ota.bin</i> fÃ¡jlja, vagy PlatformIO-val fordÃ­tva: <i>.pio/build/&lt;kÃ¶rnyezet&gt;/firmware.bin</i>).</p>␀␀Upload␀␀FeltÃ¶ltÃ©s␀In progress...␀␀Folyamatban...␀␀<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Ecowitt Weather Display</title><style>body{font-family:sans-serif;background:#121212;color:#eee;max-width:480px;margin:30px auto;padding:0 16px}input,button{font-size:18px;margin:14px 0;width:100%}button{padding:12px;background:#ff8a3d;border:0;border-radius:8px;color:#000;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .1s,transform .1s}button:active{filter:brightness(1.4);transform:scale(.97)}button:disabled{opacity:.6}</style></head><body><h2>Ecowitt Weather Display</h2><p>␀␀␀, CO2 %d ppm␀␀␀␀%04d.%02d.%02d %02d:%02d - %s<br>␀␀␀<span style='font-family:monospace;font-size:13px'>␀</span></p><form method='POST' action='/clearcrash'><button type='submit' style='background:#555;color:#eee'>␀␀␀</button></form>␀␀␀␀<h3>WiFi</h3><p>␀␀␀␀</p><form method='POST' action='/wifiset' id='wf'><button type='button' id='wsb' style='background:#444;color:#eee'>␀␀␀␀</button><select id='wsl' style='font-size:18px;width:100%;margin:6px 0'><option value=''>␀␀</option></select><label>␀␀␀</label><input name='ssid' id='wss' maxlength='32' required><label>␀</label><input name='pass' id='wsp' type='password' maxlength='64' autocomplete='new-password'><label style='display:block'><input type='checkbox' id='wsv' style='width:auto;margin:0 8px 0 0'>␀␀␀␀</label><button type='submit'>␀␀</button></form><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>␀</p><form method='POST' action='/wifiportal'><button type='submit' style='background:#444;color:#eee'>␀␀</button></form><script>(function(){var l=document.getElementById('wsl'),s=document.getElementById('wss'),p=document.getElementById('wsp');document.getElementById('wsv').onchange=function(){p.type=this.checked?'text':'password';};l.onchange=function(){if(l.value)s.value=l.value;};␀␀␀document.getElementById('wsb').onclick=function(){var b=this;b.textContent=T[0];fetch('/wifiscan').then(function(x){return x.json();}).then(function(a){l.innerHTML='';a.forEach(function(n){var o=document.createElement('option');o.value=n.s;o.textContent=n.s+' ('+n.r+' dBm'+(n.l?T[1]:T[2])+')';l.appendChild(o);});if(a.length){s.value=a[0].s;}b.textContent=T[3];}).catch(function(){b.textContent=T[4];});};})();</script>␀␀␀␀<in